# Heating schedule, read by hive-schedule. One slot per line: HH:MM <temp|off>, sorted by time.
# Temperatures are 5–32°C in 0.5 steps. The last slot carries on past midnight until the first.
# Slot times must fall on :00, :15, :30 or :45, the times hive-schedule.timer fires.

06:30 16.5   # warm up before waking
09:30 15.5   # coast
17:00 16.5   # evening
21:00 15     # overnight floor
